## Platform past-due subscriptions (AP15 — P3)

Cross-tenant billing sweeps must batch — no unbounded `findMany` on `tenantSubscription`.

| Method | Bound | Notes |
|--------|-------|-------|
| `listExpiredPastDueBatch` | `take: MAX_PAST_DUE_SUBSCRIPTION_BATCH` (50) + keyset cursor on `tenantId` | `processPastDueSubscriptions` loops until drained |

