| Concern | Code |
|---------|------|
| Bookings list projection | `BOOKING_LIST_SELECT` in `prisma-bookings.repository.ts` |
| Bookings keyset | `listByTenantPage` — `(submittedAt desc, id desc)` |
| Bookings SQL capture bind | `__testBindPrismaClientForQueryCapture` in `db/prisma.ts` |
