| Deprecated listByTenant | `listByTenantPage` cap 500 |
| Bookings detail RLS | `getById(id, tenantId)` — `withTenantRls` + `findFirst({ id, tenantId })` |
| Tours list pagination | `prisma-tour.repository.ts` `listByTenantPage` (`take: limit + 1`) |
| Tours list projection | `TOUR_LIST_PAGE_SELECT` in `prisma-tour.repository.ts` |
