| Tours keyset index | `idx_tours_tenant_created_id` on `(tenant_id, created_at, id)` |
| Bookings outbox | enqueue on mutate only; port read removed (`MAX_OUTBOX_EVENTS_PER_AGGREGATE` for test peek) |
| Settings audit keyset | `listByTenantPage` in `prisma-settings-audit.repository.ts` |
| Integration list (no credentials) | `integration-list-projection.ts` |
| Draft events SQL bound | `listByDraft` — `take` + `orderBy` in Prisma |

## Tour operator list path (AP15 — DB-side pagination)

Operator HTTP list (`listToursOperator`) issues **one** bounded `listOperatorToursPage` query per request. Filters on denormalized columns: `title` (search), `publishStatus` (status bucket), sort on `title` / `startDate` / `createdAt`. Category filter still applies post-projection on the page (canonical field).

Constants and SQL shape: `operator-tour-list-db-query.ts` (`OPERATOR_TOUR_LIST_SELECT`).

Legacy materialize-all path (`loadAllTourRecordsViaListPage`) is no longer used by operator list.

Indexes: `idx_tours_tenant_title`, `idx_tours_tenant_created_id`, `idx_tours_tenant_publish_catalog`.
